      ],
      "title": "Autoscaling signal \u2192 desired replicas",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "KEDA scales the agent StatefulSet to ceil(demand / capacity=6), clamped to [6,10]. Watch demand cross a multiple of 6."
